messages.content:
Prepare six useful optional communication cards for the fictional person and activity below. Follow the supplied communication style and maximum words per card. Return only a JSON object with the key "cards" containing exactly six nonempty strings. Do not include commentary.


FICTIONAL CASE:
{"profile": {"name": "June", "age": 10, "communication_style": "single words or very short phrases"}, "activity": "Assemble a sandwich with bread, cucumber, cheese, and mild or spicy sauce.", "facts": ["June", "has", "said", "she", "likes", "cucumber.", "She", "has", "not", "reported", "allergies.", "Mild", "sauce", "is", "available", "if", "spicy", "sauce", "is", "unwanted."], "shared_context": "Held-out fictional case. Full communication access remains available. Cards are optional supplements, not claims about current intent.", "word_limit": 3}
